\f1\b\fs26 Aquafinder __VERSION__\
\f0\b0\fs22 \
Makes Mac OS X 10.3.9 look and fit better on small screens:\
\
\f1\b Aqua Finder windows\f0\b0 : plain Aqua instead of brushed metal, a slim 15 px bottom bar with a soft shadow, and lighter pane lines.\
\
\f1\b Jaguar title bars\f0\b0 : pinstriped title bars from 10.2 in every app, see-through when inactive, and a smaller loading spinner.\
\
\f1\b Jaguar logo and Finder icon\f0\b0 : the Garamond "Mac OS X" in About This Mac and the login panel, and Jaguar's Finder icon in the Finder and the Dock.\
\
This installs all three, plus the Aquafinder app in your Applications folder. Open it any time to turn any part off or back on, or to restore Apple's original files.\
\
Only files Aquafinder recognises are changed. Each one is backed up in /Library/Aquafinder first and checked after patching. You'll need to restart when it's done.}
